  faq=[('How long do you need in Ainhoa?','One to two hours is enough; allow half a day with the walk up to the Aubépine chapel.'),('Is Ainhoa one of the most beautiful villages in France?','Yes, Ainhoa is one of the Plus Beaux Villages de France.'),('What is there to see near Ainhoa?','Espelette, Sare and the Rhune train are less than 20 minutes away.')],
